= Content Mods

This section catalogs all car and track mods in Assetto Maximus. Content mods are available from Wave 1 onward.

Mod entries follow this format: *Name* — Description. *Dependencies*. *Compatibility notes*.

== Cars

=== Wave 1 Cars

- #link("https://www.racedepartment.com/downloads/toyota-supra-mk4.32038/")[Toyota Supra MKIV] — Iconic 1990s JDM sports car. 3.0L inline-6, twin-turbo. Well-documented community port with detailed physics. *Dependencies: None*.
- #link("https://www.racedepartment.com/downloads/porsche-911-gt3-rs-991.27328/")[Porsche 911 GT3 RS (991)] — Modern track-focused Porsche. 4.0L flat-6, rear-wheel drive. High-quality model with accurate physics. *Dependencies: None*.
- #link("https://www.racedepartment.com/downloads/mazda-mx-5-cup-2016.29116/")[Mazda MX-5 Cup 2016] — Spec racing series car. Perfect for learning racecraft. *Dependencies: None*.
- #link("https://www.racedepartment.com/downloads/ferrari-488-gte.29690/")[Ferrari 488 GTE] — GTE-class endurance racer. *Dependencies: None*.

=== Car Mod Requirements

All car mods must:

- Be in `.zip`, `.rar`, or `.7z` format
- Contain a `ui_car.json` or be recognized by CM
- Place files in `assettocorsa/content/cars/[car-folder]/`
- Work with AC v1.16.4 physics engine

== Tracks

=== Wave 1 Tracks

- #link("https://www.racedepartment.com/downloads/suzuka-circuit.20759/")[Suzuka Circuit] — 5.8 km, 18 turns. FIA Grade 1. Home of the Japanese Grand Prix. High-speed first sector, technical middle sector. *Dependencies: None*.
- #link("https://www.racedepartment.com/downloads/mount-panorama-bathurst.67463/")[Mount Panorama Bathurst] — 6.2 km, 23 turns. Public road turned race track. Features the iconic Conrod Straight and terrifying downhill section. *Dependencies: None*.
- #link("https://www.racedepartment.com/downloads/nordschleife.30953/")[Nürburgring Nordschleife] — 20.8 km, 154 turns. The ultimate driver's challenge. *Dependencies: None*. *Note: This is a community conversion; verify compatibility with AC v1.16.4*.
- #link("https://www.racedepartment.com/downloads/spa-francorchamps.20864/")[Spa-Francorchamps] — 7.0 km, 19 turns. FIA Grade 1. Eau Rouge, Raidillon, and the challenging Bus Stop chicane. *Dependencies: None*.
- #link("https://www.racedepartment.com/downloads/imola.21138/")[Imola] — 4.9 km, 19 turns. Historic Italian circuit. *Dependencies: None*.
- #link("https://www.racedepartment.com/downloads/brands-hatch.21170/")[Brands Hatch] — 3.9 km, 11 turns. Classic British circuit. *Dependencies: None*.

=== Track Mod Requirements

All track mods must:

- Contain valid surfaces and AI lines
- Be compatible with AC v1.16.4 track structure
- Include at least one pit box layout
- Install to `assettocorsa/content/tracks/[track-folder]/`

